<title>USA: US aluminum center shipments down 0.6 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>US aluminum center shipments down 0.6 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipments of aluminum mill products from U.S. service centers in 1996 were 0.6 percent below the previous year, the National Association of Aluminum Distributors said.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
